{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"9.16","type":"doc","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916082151-3ifndaw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260916082151-3ifndaw","updated":"20260916083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直播URL是怎么拿到的，客户端URL又是怎么拿到的"}]},{"ID":"20260916082151-sfchlh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916082151-sfchlh5","updated":"20260916082151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"推流端"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n主播打开\"直播推流\"窗口，地址是客户端按 rtmp://服务器IP:1935/live/流名 格式确定的\n程序把它作为 FFmpeg 的输出地址，用 avformat_alloc_output_context2 指定 FLV 封装、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"avio_open2 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"建立 RTMP 连接\n把屏幕+摄像头的混合画面实时推给 Nginx-RTMP"}]},{"ID":"20260916082151-tmmn7g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916082151-tmmn7g1","updated":"20260916082151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拉流端"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n观众打开\"观看直播\"窗口，用同样的 URL（同一个\"应用名/流名\"）请求 Nginx-RTMP\n服务器把这条实时流转发过来，客户端用 FFmpeg 解码后交给 OpenGL 渲染，实现直播"}]},{"ID":"20260916082151-x6ckylv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916082151-x6ckylv","updated":"20260916082151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"URL 在哪对齐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：Nginx-RTMP 配置了 application live，靠\"流名\"匹配推流和拉流\n所以两端地址的 /live/test 必须完全一致——这是推拉双方约定的\"频道号\"，服务器只做转发不做分配"}]},{"ID":"20260916082151-38d2i3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916082151-38d2i3h","updated":"20260916082151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果被问\"URL 怎么生成的\""},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：我会说明当前直播这块是客户端按固定格式约定地址\n而点播推荐视频那套是真正动态生成的——\n从 config.ini 读服务器 IP，再拼相对路径成 rtmp://IP:1935/vod/路径 或 http://IP:8080/videouser/flv/路径\n后续直播也可以复用这套，改由服务端下发房间号"}]},{"ID":"20260916083324-racmt5i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260916083324-racmt5i","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缓冲区有没有什么弊端"}]},{"ID":"20260916083324-eghrytk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916083324-eghrytk","updated":"20260916083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缓冲的本质是\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用时间换平滑、用空间换稳定"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"\n只要引入缓冲，就一定同时付出这三样东西："}]},{"ID":"20260916083324-z4r8a8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916083324-z4r8a8l","updated":"20260916083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"延迟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而且是有下界的延迟。\n缓冲深度的物理含义就是\"数据要等多久才能被消费\"，水位有多深，延迟就至少有多深\n这是硬约束——你不可能既把缓冲做深来吸收抖动，又期望延迟很低，两个目标是零和的"}]},{"ID":"20260916083324-65986ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916083324-65986ro","updated":"20260916083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内存"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而且和并发量线性相关\n每个缓冲都要真实占住数据，单路播放可能只占几 MB，但一旦是直播多人、多路码流、或者高码率场景\n内存就是\"缓冲深度 × 并发路数\"的量级，成本会迅速放大"}]},{"ID":"20260916083324-f4ncq9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916083324-f4ncq9w","updated":"20260916083324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三，也是最容易被忽视的——它会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"掩盖问题、让反馈变迟钝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n抖动被吸收的同时，故障也被吸收：网络在恶化、解码在变慢，这些信号前期都会被缓冲吃掉\n用户和监控都看不到，等感知到卡顿时，问题已经积累了一段时间\n缓冲把\"急性故障\"变成了\"慢性退化\"，这比崩溃更难排查"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-l1ltdls","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-l1ltdls","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生产者 — 消费者模型下，有什么方案能提高效率、降低性能消耗"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-kt2k22h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-kt2k22h","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我会把它拆成四条主线：减少拷贝、减少同步、减少分配、控制水位"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-1haw41g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-1haw41g","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一，减少拷贝是收益最大的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"队列里传递的数据尽量只传\"所有权或引用\"，而不是整块内容"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用引用计数、移动语义、或者干脆交换指针"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，让数据在入队出队过程中只被搬一次甚至零次\n很多实现里一个包要经历\"读进临时 buffer → 拷进队列节点 → 拷进用户缓冲区\"三次搬运\n把它压到一次，往往比任何锁优化都有效"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-y1v6e2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-y1v6e2i","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二，减少同步开销"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n 一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"缩小临界区——锁只保护指针交接那一两行，统计量用原子操作，不要放在锁里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n二是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用条件变量替代忙等轮询"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，while + sleep 空转是在白烧 CPU\n三是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能用无锁就用无锁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——单生产者单消费者是环形缓冲加原子头尾指针最经典的场景，配合必要的内存屏障就够了\n再进一步还可以批量化提交，一次交接一批数据来摊薄锁的固定成本"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-hoyevui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-hoyevui","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三，减少分配"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n高频路径上"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"避免反复 malloc/free"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对象池或预分配环形缓冲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复用节点\n同时注意 cache 友好——比如把生产者和消费者各自读写的变量分到不同的 cache line，避免伪共享导致的缓存失效"}]},{"ID":"20260916085951-oj3inar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916085951-oj3inar","updated":"20260916085951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"策略比技巧更重要。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n 队列必须有界，有界之后要明确超限行为——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是要\"背压\"（让生产者等）还是\"丢弃\"（丢低优先级数据）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n丢得对，比传得快更能降低系统整体开销，尤其是直播这类场景，丢一个非关键帧远比让整条链路积压几十秒代价小"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-1hvtule","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-1hvtule","updated":"20260916114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RTC"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-5p68v60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-5p68v60","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RTC 不是一个协议，而是一整套协议栈，也就是通常说的 WebRTC\n它的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"目标是双向、实时、延迟在 200ms 以内的通信"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-uzissk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-uzissk2","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它最核心的三个设计，我认为是这三点："}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-o2yvrtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-o2yvrtg","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一，跑在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"UDP 上，而不是 TCP"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n因为 TCP 是可靠有序的，一丢包就得等重传，后面的数据全被堵住\n延迟会从 50ms 突然飙到 500ms——这种抖动对实时音视频是灾难\nRTC 的选择是\"宁可丢一帧，也不要卡一下\",然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用应用层的机制去补救"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-v9xjpxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-v9xjpxt","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用 RTP/RTCP 把\"传\"和\"控\"分开"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"RTP 只负责传，包上带序号和时间戳，但不保证送达"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"RTCP 是反向的反馈通道，NACK 请求重传、PLI 请求关键帧、TWCC 上报带宽估计"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这里的关键思想是：不靠\"保证送达\"解决问题，而是靠\"快速反馈 + 按需补救\"来收敛。"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-smjvvq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-smjvvq5","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三，三个自适应机制配合：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"抖动缓冲动态调深度来抗抖动，FEC 和 NACK 来抗丢包，GCC 拥塞控制根据延迟梯度和丢包率实时调码率。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n带宽不够时就主动丢视频帧保音频——音频优先是实时通信里一条很重要的原则。"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-r0p23vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-r0p23vb","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外还有几个工程上绕不开的点：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"信令 WebRTC 自己不管，要业务自己实现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\nNAT 穿透要靠 ICE，也就是 STUN 打洞加 TURN 中继兜底，TURN 是实际部署的主要成本；\n安全上走 DTLS 协商密钥、SRTP 加密传输\n拓扑上现在是 SFU 为主——服务端只转发不混流，老的 MCU 混流方案因为服务端压力和延迟已经很少用了"}]},{"ID":"20260916104720-y81dshs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916104720-y81dshs","updated":"20260916104720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一句话总结：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"RTC 的本质是\"用 UDP 换低延迟、用反馈换可靠性、用自适应换弱网体验\""},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916114933-gr3qf69","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916114933-gr3qf69","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个变量从声明到正在使用，物理内存是什么时候分配的"}]},{"ID":"20260916114933-n7zrx3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916114933-n7zrx3a","updated":"20260916114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现代操作系统"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"采用虚拟内存延迟分配"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n变量声明的时候，只会分配虚拟地址空间，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不会立刻分配物理内存"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n 等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"到第一次读写访问这个变量时，CPU 地址转换发现没有物理页映射，触发缺页中断"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n操作系统这时才分配物理页框，建立虚实地址映射\n之后再使用变量，就直接走页表访问物理内存了"}]},{"ID":"20260916114933-2hhes00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916114933-2hhes00","updated":"20260916114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同类型变量细节略有区别：\n局部栈变量，函数进入开辟栈帧拿到虚拟地址；\n全局 / 静态变量在编译时确定虚拟地址，程序加载时预留虚拟空间；\nmalloc/new 堆内存，调用时只拿到虚拟地址\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"它们都遵循同一个核心："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"声明只占虚拟地址，第一次访问才分配物理内存"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916114933-u1ollzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916114933-u1ollzw","updated":"20260916114933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量声明：编译器记录符号、类型、虚拟地址偏移；只分配虚拟地址空间，物理内存 0 占用\n进程加载 / 函数执行：进程拿到合法虚拟地址，页表标记为无效，没有物理页映射\n第一次访问变量（读 / 写）：\nMMU 做地址翻译，发现页表有效位 = 0 → 缺页中断，陷入内核\n操作系统找空闲物理内存页框，建立虚拟地址 ↔ 物理页映射，更新页表\n回到用户态，重新执行访问指令，物理内存分配完成\n后续反复使用变量：页表已经映射，直接虚实地址..."}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-llw7icg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-llw7icg","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"定时任务怎么注册的"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-o4z5yms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-o4z5yms","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"登录完成后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在 startup_management.cpp 中通过 work.AddConcurrentTask() 注册周期任务"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用 #if RDM_BUILD 宏包裹确保只在蓝盾包编译\n构造时传 24h 编译期常量，首检延迟 2 秒（SetFirstIntervalTimeInSeconds(2)），后续每 24h 触发一次 DoOnInterval()"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-449ub2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-449ub2g","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AddConcurrentTask 本身其实什么都不干，它只是登记一个\"工厂函数\"，不会立刻执行"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-2alckso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-2alckso","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正到点触发的时候，框架才把这些工厂函数挨个调用，生成具体任务"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"然后统一丢给一个并发执行器"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n执行器干的事很朴素：\n把所有子任务一次性全部发出去，谁都不等谁，这就是并发的来源——它不是自己开线程\n而是把任务一次性交给底层的统一分发器去跑"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-urrr7qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-urrr7qn","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着做计数管理：\n每个子任务跑完就回调回来，把自己从待完成列表里删掉，列表清空就代表这一整组结束了\n而且"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个回调被特意投回任务自己的执行线程"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以管理这批任务时天然是单线程的，不用加锁"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-et48jsl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-et48jsl","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CGI 请求在哪个线程发送接收的"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-0ct25qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-0ct25qt","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CGI 在 UI 线程发送"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n框架要求发起线程必须是 UI 线程\n周期任务运行在执行线程，所以先 GetUIThread()-\u003ePostTask 切到 UI 线程发请求\n回调里再 GetExecuteThread()-\u003ePostTask 切回执行线程处理结果，避免跨线程操作 timer 和成员状态"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-e9fj5x4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-e9fj5x4","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节流判定怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-mtrc35a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-mtrc35a","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"弹窗前读取持久化的 last_notify_time（GlobalConfig 存储），判断 now - last_notify_time \u0026lt; 24h"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n未过期则跳过弹窗但保留已下载包。时间戳在 PostEvent 请求弹窗后立即写入（不是等 UI 展示完），因为通知是异步投递（PostMessage），唯一不一致窗口是投递后进程崩溃，误差方向安全——少弹一次而非重复骚扰。续期时还会向节流门槛对齐，避免检测周期与节流起点不同导致间隔近 48h。"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-ie49203","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-ie49203","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不是\"固定每 24 小时跑一次\"，而是\"每轮跑完重新算下一次什么时候跑\"，算的时候把节流也考虑进去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-l69ahfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-l69ahfx","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先默认下一轮 24 小时后\n再算一个 remain = 节流还剩多久到期（上次提醒时间 + 24h − 现在）\n如果节流还没到期、而且比 24 小时更早到期，那就别等一整天，把下一轮提前到节流到期那一刻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-qkooehm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-qkooehm","updated":"20260916145955"}},{"ID":"20260916145955-ucdy8a7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-ucdy8a7","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"安装的单例弹窗做了什么处理"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-po60n9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-po60n9e","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弹窗前检测 suggest_instance 单例是否被占用（手动检查更新或上一轮静默提醒留下的旧窗口）\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"被占用就用同步的 ::DestroyWindow() 销毁旧窗口再重建"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不能用 Close()（异步 PostMessage(WM_CLOSE)）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，否则本函数返回前旧窗口还在\n会走\"只置顶\"分支导致本轮提醒弹不出来，且时间戳已写入，提醒直接丢失\n销毁限定 package_ready，蓝盾包手动链路不受影响"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-bo0dsjk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-bo0dsjk","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成这个需求有什么亮点"}]},{"ID":"20260916145955-ep8fose","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916145955-ep8fose","updated":"20260916145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双闸门隔离：编译期 RDM_BUILD 宏 + 运行期 Debug 开关，零外溢到现网\n物理隔离：静默包用独立文件类别 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp，与手动跨线包互不可见，避免互删装错版本\n节流对齐：检测周期向节流门槛对齐 + 最小间隔保护，精确控制 24h 弹窗间隔\n线程安全范式：照抄框架既有范式（GetUIThread/GetExecuteThread 切换），避免跨线程竞态\n单例窗口销毁重建：解决\"只置顶旧窗口\"导致提醒丢失的隐蔽 bug\n异步通知解耦：logic 层只 PostEvent，UI 层 Register 后自取句柄弹窗，保持层级清晰"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-7b2sqt5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-7b2sqt5","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝盾包版本检测安装的流程是怎么样的"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-z2ltok7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-z2ltok7","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一、任务启动与初始化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户登录后，系统注册定时任务。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"任务首次执行延迟2秒，之后每24小时执行一次"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，确保及时检测新版本。"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-cdtc97c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-cdtc97c","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"二、版本检测流程"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-70jaypg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-70jaypg","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"闸门校验：任务开始时进行三项检查\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是否为蓝盾包（非正式包）、Debug开关是否开启（默认关闭）、当前流水线ID是否有效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n任一条件不满足则跳过本轮检测\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CGI请求"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：向服务端发送"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CGI 3502请求"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，查询当前流水线最新成功构建的版本号。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"版本比对"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"将服务器返回版本与本地运行版本进行比对"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，仅当前者更高时才继续。"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-ldtnd30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-ldtnd30","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三、静默下载与存储"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n发现新版本后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"系统使用固定URL模板拼接下载地址"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（避免使用错误的详情页地址），后台静默下载安装包\n下载的文件存储为独立类别（PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"与手动下载的包物理隔离"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，互不影响"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-e8n3cml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-e8n3cml","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四、节流与弹窗提醒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n下载完成后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"系统进行24小时节流判定（基于服务器时间防篡改）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n若满足条件，则通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"通知中心发送消息"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，UI层监听后复用现有的升级弹窗，直接显示“下载完成”状态，提示用户安装。"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-6eketq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-6eketq7","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五、安装与清理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户点击“立即安装”后，系统校验安装包存在性，然后调用安装程序\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"若用户关闭弹窗，已下载的包会保留，直到下一轮检测时清理过期包"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n整个过程通过#if RDM_BUILD宏隔离，确保现网正式包不受影响。"}]},{"ID":"20260916150006-rya1iz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916150006-rya1iz1","updated":"20260916150006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个流程设计兼顾了自动化与低打扰：\n后台自动检测和下载，仅在必要时弹窗提醒，且受24小时节流控制，避免频繁打扰用户"}]}]}